{
  "opencollection": "1.0.0",
  "info": {
    "name": "TriplyDB Accounts Jobs API",
    "version": "26.5.104"
  },
  "request": {
    "auth": {
      "type": "bearer",
      "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
    }
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Jobs",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create an import job",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.lod.uba.uva.nl/datasets/:account/:dataset/jobs",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "account",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Account name (user or group)"
              },
              {
                "name": "dataset",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Dataset name"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates a new data import job.\n\n**Simple upload** (files under 5 MB): send the file as\n`multipart/form-data`. The job is created and starts processing\nautomatically.\n\n```\ncurl -H 'Authorization: Bearer TOKEN' \\\n  -X POST https://api.INSTANCE/datasets/ACCOUNT/DATASET/jobs \\\n  -F file=@./myfile.trig\n```\n\n**Large-scale upload** (files over 5 MB): send a JSON body to\ncreate the job, then upload files using the\n[tus resumable upload protocol](https://tus.io/protocols/resumable-upload),\nand finally ca"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Cancel all error jobs",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "https://api.lod.uba.uva.nl/datasets/:account/:dataset/jobs",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "account",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Account name (user or group)"
              },
              {
                "name": "dataset",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Dataset name"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Cancel all error jobs"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get job details",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://api.lod.uba.uva.nl/datasets/:account/:dataset/jobs/:jobId",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "account",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Account name (user or group)"
              },
              {
                "name": "dataset",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Dataset name"
              },
              {
                "name": "jobId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Job identifier"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Get job details"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Cancel a job",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "https://api.lod.uba.uva.nl/datasets/:account/:dataset/jobs/:jobId",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "account",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Account name (user or group)"
              },
              {
                "name": "dataset",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Dataset name"
              },
              {
                "name": "jobId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Job identifier"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Cancel a job"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Start a job",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.lod.uba.uva.nl/datasets/:account/:dataset/jobs/:jobId/start",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "account",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Account name (user or group)"
              },
              {
                "name": "dataset",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Dataset name"
              },
              {
                "name": "jobId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Job identifier"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Start a job"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Reset a job",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.lod.uba.uva.nl/datasets/:account/:dataset/jobs/:jobId/reset",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "account",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Account name (user or group)"
              },
              {
                "name": "dataset",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Dataset name"
              },
              {
                "name": "jobId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Job identifier"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Reset a job"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Delete a source file from a job",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "https://api.lod.uba.uva.nl/datasets/:account/:dataset/jobs/:jobId/:sourceFileId",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "account",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Account name (user or group)"
              },
              {
                "name": "dataset",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Dataset name"
              },
              {
                "name": "jobId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Job identifier"
              },
              {
                "name": "sourceFileId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Delete a source file from a job"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
}